{
  "id": "p48",
  "title": "The Sixtieth Year of the Nuclear Department",
  "titleZh": "核物理系的第六十年",
  "topic": "大学核物理系存废听证",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The city university marks the sixtieth year of its nuclear department.",
        "zh": "这所城市大学迎来其核物理系第六十周年。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A growing debt and a sudden collapse shock the whole faculty.",
        "zh": "不断增长的债务和突然的崩溃震动了整个学院。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The chief of the department still holds the title of acting dean.",
        "zh": "系主任仍然挂着代理院长的头衔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My honest opinion is mixed about the coming closure.",
        "zh": "我对即将到来的关闭持混合的诚实看法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They adopt a new mechanism to share the teaching load.",
        "zh": "他们采用一种新机制来分担教学负担。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The department must hire new talent and protect every pension.",
        "zh": "系里必须雇用新人才，并保住每一份养老金。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The annual fee is a fairly small amount for most local students.",
        "zh": "对大多数本地学生来说，年费是相当小的数目。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A legal suit tests the freedom of every research group.",
        "zh": "一场法律诉讼考验着每个研究群体的自由。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The latest photo shot is absolutely full of angry faces.",
        "zh": "最新的照片里满是不满的面孔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Urban soil near the campus holds an odd chemical trace.",
        "zh": "校园附近的城市土壤带有一丝奇怪的化学痕迹。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Then the fault is not theirs, unlike the earlier report.",
        "zh": "那么错不在他们，不像早先的报告所说。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Donations pour in after news of the coming disaster.",
        "zh": "即将到来的灾难消息传出后，捐款涌入。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The opposite view comes from an outstanding young teacher.",
        "zh": "相反的观点来自一位杰出的年轻教师。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small reward goes to the team that cuts carbon.",
        "zh": "一小笔奖励发给减少碳排放的团队。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their superb data convince even the doubtful dean.",
        "zh": "他们一流的数据说服了连多疑的院长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A neat stall sells sauce and bread from a local trader.",
        "zh": "一个整洁的摊位卖酱料和一位本地商贩的面包。"
      },
      {
        "en": "No quick cure appears before the cold autumn election in May.",
        "zh": "在镇上寒冷的秋季选举之前，看不到速效的解决办法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plan's best feature is a considerable and steady saving for all.",
        "zh": "这项计划最好的特点是相当可观的稳定节省。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A commercial partner wants a share of the old territory.",
        "zh": "一个商业伙伴想要旧有地盘的一份份额。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A panel meets, and one implication is clear to all.",
        "zh": "一个小组开会，其中一个含义对所有人都是清楚的。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A public inquiry draws keen support from many young students.",
        "zh": "一次公开调查赢得了许多年轻学生的热烈支持。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's numerous gifts help sustain the department.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的大量礼物帮助维持这个系。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, as a last resort, the staff seek an ultimate ruling.",
        "zh": "后来，作为最后手段，教职员寻求一项最终裁决。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A budget raid brings a student delegation to the gate.",
        "zh": "一场预算突袭把学生代表团带到门口。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the meeting they set forth how waiting became torture.",
        "zh": "会议期间，他们陈述了等待如何变成折磨。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The final stage wins wide publicity in the local city press.",
        "zh": "最后阶段在本地城市媒体上获得了广泛宣传。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Alumni lobby the council and fully back the plan.",
        "zh": "校友游说议会，并全力支持这项计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My sister's activism rests on a firm belief in science.",
        "zh": "我姐姐的行动主义建立在坚定的科学信念上。"
      }
    ]
  ],
